WEBVTT

00:02:59.926 --> 00:03:01.636
So I just have to emphasize

00:03:01.636 --> 00:03:03.721
that the changes
we’re talking about today,

00:03:03.721 --> 00:03:08.267
these are not incremental, small advances
in rocketry and spacecraft.

00:03:08.601 --> 00:03:11.187
These are truly
transformational technologies

00:03:11.187 --> 00:03:13.856
that are giving us
completely new capabilities

00:03:13.856 --> 00:03:16.442
and changing the paradigm
for space exploration.

00:03:17.526 --> 00:03:19.111
And what’s really going to happen

00:03:19.111 --> 00:03:21.489
is we’re going to move
from where we are today,

00:03:21.489 --> 00:03:23.241
which is usually, you know,

00:03:23.241 --> 00:03:26.827
more specialized, one-off,
boutique-style missions

00:03:26.827 --> 00:03:31.499
into more mass-produced,
large-scale operations in space.